      "text": "```\r\nThe Core Problems a Monorepo Tool Solves\r\n========================================="
    },
    {
      "id": "16-MONOREPO.md#007",
      "path": [
        "16-MONOREPO.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
